WEBVTT

01:29.680 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:46.320 --> 01:47.440
Bao.

01:48.680 --> 01:49.560
Come here, good girl.

01:50.840 --> 01:53.120
How do you know my name is Bao?

01:53.640 --> 01:54.520
How do I know?

01:55.560 --> 01:56.920
Lansheng

01:57.000 --> 01:59.080
often mentions you in front of me,

01:59.160 --> 02:00.720
calling you a mischievous little girl.

02:00.800 --> 02:02.160
So, that's how I know.

02:05.320 --> 02:07.680
Lansheng often talks about you too.

02:08.280 --> 02:10.560
He says he has the most elegant

02:10.639 --> 02:12.080
and kind father in the world.

02:14.520 --> 02:16.520
If only my father were here.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.160
Oh, right…

02:19.240 --> 02:20.360
Lansheng borrowed
the Blood Mirror from me,

02:20.440 --> 02:22.840
saying he'd go with you
to find your father.

02:22.920 --> 02:25.120
Did you find anything on this trip?

02:28.680 --> 02:30.760
My father saved me in secret,

02:31.360 --> 02:33.400
but he wouldn't show himself.

02:33.480 --> 02:36.320
Does that mean my father doesn't like me,

02:37.960 --> 02:39.680
so he won't come home

02:39.760 --> 02:41.880
or see me anymore?

02:44.760 --> 02:47.120
No, that's not it. Good girl,

02:47.760 --> 02:50.680
what father in this world
doesn't love his own child?

02:51.280 --> 02:52.200
Maybe

02:52.760 --> 02:54.840
your father has something
more urgent to deal with.

02:55.480 --> 02:58.000
Once he's done,
he'll definitely come back to see you.

02:58.960 --> 02:59.920
My mother said the same thing.

03:00.680 --> 03:03.480
She said my father
is the nicest person in the world

03:04.080 --> 03:06.120
and that we'll definitely reunite someday.

03:06.760 --> 03:07.680
Yes.

03:09.600 --> 03:11.440
That day will surely come.

03:16.760 --> 03:18.840
The bustle of the Jade Sky Palace is nice.

03:18.920 --> 03:21.560
However, I think you need some peace too.

03:22.560 --> 03:24.120
This is my secret place.

03:24.720 --> 03:25.960
This tree

03:26.040 --> 03:28.080
has been my companion
since childhood, my Worry-Free Tree.

03:28.840 --> 03:30.240
Worry-Free Tree?

03:31.520 --> 03:34.360
It's covered with so many red ribbons.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.480
Do you have that many worries?

03:36.560 --> 03:37.640
No, they're not worries.

03:38.160 --> 03:39.200
They're joys.

03:39.840 --> 03:42.760
Joys? Then why call it a Worry-Free Tree?

03:44.160 --> 03:45.040
Well,

03:45.120 --> 03:46.840
whenever something
made me especially happy,

03:46.920 --> 03:49.320
I'd throw a ribbon onto the tree.

03:49.400 --> 03:52.000
That way, I could preserve
that moment of happiness.

03:52.080 --> 03:54.480
Later, when I faced troubles,

03:54.560 --> 03:56.560
I'd walk under this tree,

03:56.640 --> 03:58.320
look at all the happiness hanging on it,

03:58.400 --> 04:02.000
and feel like my current troubles
weren't so bad after all.

04:02.680 --> 04:03.720
Actually, when you think about it,

04:04.320 --> 04:05.480
in life,

04:06.320 --> 04:07.400
is there more sorrow than joy,

04:07.480 --> 04:09.320
or more joy than sorrow?

04:09.920 --> 04:11.760
It depends on what you choose to remember.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.240
True.

04:17.320 --> 04:18.760
In this lifetime,

04:19.360 --> 04:21.160
what we leave behind

04:21.800 --> 04:23.880
depends on what we choose to remember.

04:25.560 --> 04:26.560
Try it.

04:28.360 --> 04:30.440
Lately, I haven't had
anything particularly joyful.

04:31.480 --> 04:32.320
Next time,

04:32.400 --> 04:34.520
when the moment is right,
I'll come here with you to hang a ribbon.

04:34.600 --> 04:35.600
Well,

04:35.680 --> 04:37.760
if you ever feel troubled,

04:37.840 --> 04:39.120
you can hang it there too.

04:39.760 --> 04:42.400
From today on, the rules
of the Worry-Free Tree have changed.

04:42.480 --> 04:45.360
It won't just hold my joys,
it can carry your sorrows too.

04:46.240 --> 04:48.880
I hope my joys can ease your sorrows.

04:49.480 --> 04:51.960
Whatever's on your mind,
you can share it with me.

04:52.800 --> 04:54.480
Whether it's joy or sadness,

04:54.560 --> 04:56.160
it's easier to carry together

04:56.240 --> 04:57.840
than alone.

05:11.440 --> 05:12.560
It's up there!

05:19.160 --> 05:20.320
Fu Lansheng,

05:20.920 --> 05:22.640
thank you for sharing your joy with me.

05:23.240 --> 05:24.880
I told you to stop saying
thank you all the time.

05:25.520 --> 05:26.360
Come on. Let's keep going.

05:26.960 --> 05:28.800
The higher you throw it,
the more your troubles fade.

05:28.880 --> 05:30.320
Here's one for you.
Let's throw it together.

05:34.480 --> 05:36.560
One, two, three!

05:39.640 --> 05:40.480
It's up there!

05:42.960 --> 05:44.000
Oh, by the way,

05:44.080 --> 05:46.400
if you have anything on your mind,
any wishes, you can tell it to the tree.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.160
Once you've said it, you'll feel relieved.

05:51.920 --> 05:53.200
This will be your secret with the tree.

05:53.280 --> 05:54.720
I won't listen.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.760
Feel free to say it!

06:04.000 --> 06:05.000
I hope

06:06.040 --> 06:08.000
to live for myself in the future,

06:08.600 --> 06:09.800
to follow my own heart.

06:11.560 --> 06:13.600
I hope those who are no longer by my side

06:14.480 --> 06:16.160
and those who still are

06:17.160 --> 06:19.400
can see a new Gao Qiumin…

06:21.120 --> 06:23.440
someone they're proud of,

06:23.960 --> 06:25.840
and someone I can be proud of too.

06:27.440 --> 06:29.120
I still hope that one day,

06:29.200 --> 06:31.920
I can stand alone with my sword
at the pinnacle of humanity,

06:32.520 --> 06:33.920
fulfilling my unfinished dreams.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.240
Fu Lansheng!

06:50.120 --> 06:51.560
It's so good to have you by my side.

06:58.800 --> 07:02.080
PHOENIX PERCH FOREST

07:06.680 --> 07:09.200
Sang Qi once stayed
in the East Sea for a time,

07:10.040 --> 07:12.640
but both humans and spirits rejected him.

07:13.560 --> 07:16.080
He was bullied endlessly,
left with no place to call home.

07:17.040 --> 07:20.320
Eventually, he fell into the Dark Abyss,
where he cultivated demonic power,

07:21.040 --> 07:23.600
gaining the trust of the former
Demon Lord step by step,

07:24.240 --> 07:25.640
until he struck the deadly blow

07:26.160 --> 07:27.600
and took his place

07:27.680 --> 07:29.840
as the new Lord of the Dark Abyss.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.280
It's said that cultivating demonic power

07:32.000 --> 07:33.480
requires enduring a lot of suffering.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.040
In a place like the Dark Abyss,

07:37.120 --> 07:39.400
you can't survive without power.

07:40.000 --> 07:41.440
How could someone
like you possibly understand?

07:44.760 --> 07:46.360
If I had met you earlier,

07:47.720 --> 07:49.400
maybe everything
would have been different.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.520
I am the Saintess of the Dark Abyss.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.760
That's how I managed
to save you from the Lava.

07:54.600 --> 07:56.400
If I were just a lowly spirit slave,

07:57.200 --> 07:58.680
you wouldn't even know who I am.

08:02.520 --> 08:03.680
Don't stray too far from me.

08:05.320 --> 08:06.440
I already told you,

08:06.520 --> 08:07.800
please don't mess with me, Mr. Xie.

08:08.400 --> 08:09.880
This place is dangerous.

08:09.960 --> 08:11.160
You'd better not lose me here.

08:14.680 --> 08:15.840
Life and death are governed by fate.

08:24.640 --> 08:25.720
Xie Xuechen!

08:36.240 --> 08:37.440
Come here quickly!

08:37.520 --> 08:39.080
The one beside you is a fake!

08:43.559 --> 08:45.280
What are you?

08:46.240 --> 08:48.080
That's what I should ask you.

08:48.160 --> 08:49.200
You forest spirit,

08:49.280 --> 08:51.040
how dare you take my form

08:51.120 --> 08:52.120
and deceive Xie Xuechen?

08:54.720 --> 08:56.000
What a reversal of the truth.

08:56.600 --> 08:58.400
You copy me well enough,

08:58.480 --> 08:59.440
but who's real and who's fake

08:59.520 --> 09:01.160
will be revealed after a fight.

09:01.760 --> 09:03.120
Exactly,

09:03.200 --> 09:04.600
who's real and who's fake

09:04.680 --> 09:05.720
will be revealed after a fight.

09:06.480 --> 09:07.720
You monster…

09:09.520 --> 09:10.840
How is this possible?

09:10.920 --> 09:12.280
Disassociation was crafted
by Sang Qi himself.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.280
There can't be a second one in this world.

09:18.160 --> 09:20.280
Xie Xuechen, has she bewitched you?

09:20.880 --> 09:21.800
I am the real one!

09:26.320 --> 09:27.480
You are indeed identical.

09:27.560 --> 09:28.520
You don't trust me?

09:35.520 --> 09:38.040
If you want to play, count me out.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.840
I told you, I'm the real one--

09:57.960 --> 10:00.360
This is a forest spirit. It's the fruit
of the Soul Capturing Bloom.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.080
Its scent

10:03.680 --> 10:04.840
can also cause illusions.

10:06.960 --> 10:08.800
In your illusion,

10:08.880 --> 10:10.880
I am always the one who loves you deeply?

10:10.960 --> 10:12.280
Your appearances were the same,

10:13.200 --> 10:14.120
but I know

10:14.840 --> 10:16.160
the one being harsh to me now

10:17.200 --> 10:18.240
is the real you.

10:21.680 --> 10:22.880
What do you mean by this?

10:25.480 --> 10:26.960
This item is called String Bonding.

10:27.600 --> 10:28.680
The two connected by it

10:29.320 --> 10:30.400
cannot be more than three zhang apart.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.720
I know what String Bonding is.

10:33.800 --> 10:34.760
I'm asking what you mean by using it.

10:35.400 --> 10:37.320
I was worried you might accidentally

10:37.960 --> 10:38.840
get separated from me,

10:40.240 --> 10:41.440
or deliberately try to.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.960
Demons may be killed, but not humiliated.

10:47.680 --> 10:48.960
Are you treating me like a dog on a leash?

10:49.560 --> 10:50.600
Of course not.

10:51.960 --> 10:53.000
Dogs…

10:54.000 --> 10:55.160
are usually leashed by the neck, right?

10:55.760 --> 10:56.800
You…

10:56.880 --> 10:57.760
Let's go.

11:08.120 --> 11:09.000
Xuanling!

11:09.680 --> 11:10.680
Xuanling!

11:36.760 --> 11:38.640
-You're awake.
-I…

11:39.880 --> 11:41.240
The miasma in this forest is poisonous.

11:41.320 --> 11:42.920
I gave you an antidote pill,

11:43.840 --> 11:45.520
but during the detox process,

11:46.640 --> 11:48.840
-you'll temporarily lose your sight.
-Lose my sight?

11:50.040 --> 11:51.240
Are you saving me or punishing me?

11:52.040 --> 11:53.000
Mu Xuanling…

11:55.800 --> 11:57.040
I'm sorry.

11:57.120 --> 11:59.160
I've done some things before
that made you upset.

11:59.920 --> 12:00.880
I feel guilty about them,

12:02.400 --> 12:03.800
and I want to make it up to you,

12:04.920 --> 12:06.600
but I don't know where to start.

12:07.400 --> 12:08.800
In the past, I always thought

12:09.800 --> 12:11.640
I carried the burden of the Snow City,

12:12.440 --> 12:13.840
that I had no other choice.

12:16.720 --> 12:17.680
But after meeting you again,

12:18.640 --> 12:19.880
I've come to realize

12:20.640 --> 12:22.800
I'm not just the Lord of the Snow City,

12:23.720 --> 12:25.200
I'm also my own person.

12:27.280 --> 12:28.760
You're the fake Xie Xuechen?

12:29.760 --> 12:30.800
I am the real me.

12:36.560 --> 12:37.600
Was this jade pendant

12:38.440 --> 12:39.360
given to you by Nan Xuyue?

12:41.640 --> 12:42.560
You…

12:43.080 --> 12:44.640
He gave you such a precious artifact!

12:44.720 --> 12:45.880
Did he say anything to you?

12:48.560 --> 12:50.080
What does that have to do with you?

12:54.320 --> 12:55.400
What are you doing?

12:57.760 --> 12:58.720
Nothing.

13:14.880 --> 13:15.800
It smells so good.

13:18.520 --> 13:19.400
Are there

13:20.400 --> 13:21.760
a lot of peach blossoms here?

13:24.880 --> 13:25.960
There are some planted,

13:27.200 --> 13:28.600
but the scent isn't from the trees.

13:30.840 --> 13:31.920
It's the poison from the miasma.

13:32.000 --> 13:33.640
Those poisoned

13:33.720 --> 13:35.480
will develop many
peach-blossom patterns on their skin.

13:35.560 --> 13:37.880
During detox, their bodies will emit

13:37.960 --> 13:39.480
a strong peach-blossom fragrance.

13:40.920 --> 13:42.760
When the patterns disappear,

13:43.840 --> 13:44.880
the poison will be completely cleared.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.120
Patterns?

13:48.640 --> 13:49.720
Are there a lot?

13:50.920 --> 13:53.080
Does that mean
there are some on my face too?

13:53.160 --> 13:54.400
Does it look ugly?

13:59.720 --> 14:00.880
Your face…

14:02.480 --> 14:03.680
doesn't seem to have any.

14:05.720 --> 14:06.880
There are a few on your neck, though.

14:09.000 --> 14:10.000
And here…

14:15.080 --> 14:16.160
And where else?

14:20.440 --> 14:21.640
You don't need to worry too much.

14:22.600 --> 14:25.680
These patterns grow on your skin
like peach blossoms.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.080
They aren't ugly at all.

14:29.360 --> 14:30.440
It's just that…

14:33.040 --> 14:33.880
Just that what?

14:38.600 --> 14:39.680
It's just that

14:40.640 --> 14:41.920
the fragrance is relaxing

14:43.040 --> 14:43.920
and pleasant,

14:45.520 --> 14:47.200
and it makes people lose focus easily.

14:55.120 --> 14:56.600
I'd better go guard the cave entrance.

15:04.760 --> 15:06.040
Funny, isn't it?

15:07.240 --> 15:10.080
Back when I was in the Dark Abyss,

15:10.160 --> 15:11.720
I was always on edge.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.960
Sometimes,
even when nothing was happening,

15:16.280 --> 15:18.640
I would stay awake all night.

15:20.280 --> 15:21.480
But last night,

15:22.280 --> 15:23.560
with you keeping watch by my side,

15:24.320 --> 15:25.600
I fell asleep quickly

15:26.600 --> 15:28.040
and slept dreamlessly until dawn.

15:30.040 --> 15:31.720
It seems that Mr. Xie's image

15:31.800 --> 15:33.840
as a noble gentleman

15:33.920 --> 15:35.040
has truly left a deep impression.

15:44.120 --> 15:45.240
Xie Xuechen…

15:47.040 --> 15:48.160
don't you think…

15:49.800 --> 15:51.040
this peach blossom scent

15:51.560 --> 15:52.800
is getting stronger?

15:55.920 --> 15:57.040
It's making me…

15:59.160 --> 16:00.600
a little hard to breathe.

16:19.240 --> 16:20.200
You…

16:23.680 --> 16:25.080
Your heart is hard,

16:26.880 --> 16:27.960
but your lips are soft.

16:29.040 --> 16:29.880
You…

16:30.400 --> 16:31.880
You're definitely getting back at me!

16:33.640 --> 16:34.800
If I say I'm not,

16:35.840 --> 16:36.960
will you believe me?

16:40.120 --> 16:41.360
I will.

16:41.440 --> 16:43.480
You… You should let me go.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.080
What happened before was my fault.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.680
I shouldn't have messed with you.

16:51.040 --> 16:52.080
Mr. Xie,

16:52.920 --> 16:54.240
you're an upright person,

16:54.760 --> 16:55.960
noble and pure.

16:56.680 --> 16:58.600
You shouldn't use
such a way to get revenge.

16:59.640 --> 17:00.760
How unfair for you.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.400
First,

17:04.720 --> 17:05.960
you didn't do anything wrong.

17:07.160 --> 17:08.560
I was the one who did.

17:09.839 --> 17:10.880
Second,

17:12.079 --> 17:14.200
I'm not as noble and pure as you think.

17:15.359 --> 17:16.800
I'm just an ordinary man

17:17.520 --> 17:19.440
who can feel and be moved.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.280
Third,

17:22.560 --> 17:23.400
I'm not taking revenge.

17:24.640 --> 17:25.680
Fourth,

17:26.359 --> 17:27.319
I don't feel wronged.

17:29.320 --> 17:30.240
Fifth,

17:32.360 --> 17:33.840
I won't let you go again.

18:06.280 --> 18:07.360
Mu Xuanling,

18:09.120 --> 18:09.960
who am I?

18:20.560 --> 18:21.560
I'm sorry.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.200
I shouldn't have taken
advantage of the situation.

18:27.600 --> 18:28.680
Apologizing now…

18:30.120 --> 18:31.000
Does that mean you know you were wrong?

18:31.080 --> 18:31.960
Yes.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.240
I should've kissed you
when you could see me.

18:37.080 --> 18:38.520
You… I'll go guard the cave entrance.

18:40.240 --> 18:41.400
Get some rest.

18:49.920 --> 18:50.880
Mu Xuanling,

18:51.520 --> 18:52.400
what's wrong with you?

18:53.240 --> 18:54.480
Can't you even keep this much composure?

18:55.360 --> 18:56.360
That was close.

19:18.840 --> 19:21.520
Sir, you seem restless tonight.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.560
I gave her a jade pendant

19:26.320 --> 19:28.240
embedded with my protective array.

19:29.560 --> 19:31.200
But just now, I sensed…

19:31.800 --> 19:33.200
the array was triggered.

19:33.960 --> 19:35.040
There's danger?

19:36.520 --> 19:37.560
It was only triggered,

19:38.080 --> 19:39.160
but it wasn't destroyed.

19:40.560 --> 19:42.040
So, it doesn't seem serious.

19:44.720 --> 19:46.120
Sir, rest early.

19:47.000 --> 19:49.200
We'll set off at first light tomorrow.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.480
Did I say where we're going?

19:55.840 --> 19:57.040
You're obsessed with something

19:57.880 --> 19:59.080
you can't let go of,

19:59.160 --> 20:00.280
so you'll end up going there eventually.

20:02.200 --> 20:03.480
The Ethereal Jade Island
is Spirit Clan territory.

20:04.480 --> 20:05.600
It's not safe.

20:05.680 --> 20:06.680
I'll go with you.

20:09.560 --> 20:10.800
There's one thing

20:11.520 --> 20:12.480
you've never mentioned,

20:13.480 --> 20:14.760
and I've never asked.

20:16.840 --> 20:18.520
But tonight, I'm curious.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.600
What is it?

20:22.120 --> 20:23.120
Eleven years ago,

20:23.640 --> 20:25.800
you came to Greenview Heights,
wounded all over,

20:26.960 --> 20:28.680
swearing ten years of loyalty

20:29.280 --> 20:31.400
in exchange for spirit medicine
to save your brother.

20:35.520 --> 20:37.960
Now, the ten-year vow
has long been fulfilled.

20:38.560 --> 20:41.280
Your abilities are remarkable,
and the world is vast,

20:42.160 --> 20:43.240
so why haven't you left?

20:44.240 --> 20:47.040
So, are you trying to send me away?

20:49.400 --> 20:50.360
Feng Yao,

20:53.800 --> 20:55.360
I'm not a good person.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.320
I know.

21:00.520 --> 21:01.680
I was there the day the Spirit Clan

21:03.440 --> 21:04.760
attacked Greenview Heights.

21:05.440 --> 21:07.280
I also know about
your dealings with the Master

21:08.000 --> 21:09.040
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.080
Frankly,

21:12.720 --> 21:14.200
I'm not exactly a good person either.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.520
If you're a bad person,

21:17.280 --> 21:18.800
why not act in your own interest?

21:20.320 --> 21:21.680
Maybe it's because…

21:24.480 --> 21:25.920
I have nowhere else to go

21:27.120 --> 21:28.600
and nothing else to do.

21:36.840 --> 21:38.480
Since you're willing to stay,

21:39.720 --> 21:41.240
then keep traveling with me.

21:41.920 --> 21:43.560
Let's walk this path together

21:43.640 --> 21:44.920
and see…

21:46.680 --> 21:48.560
if the end is bright or dark.

21:49.680 --> 21:53.080
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

21:57.880 --> 22:00.160
His Grace still refuses to see visitors.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.120
Please leave.

22:03.640 --> 22:04.800
If that's the case,

22:06.080 --> 22:07.000
I'll take my leave.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.080
You…

22:14.920 --> 22:17.320
Just a Su Ningxi, who died 20 years ago,

22:18.520 --> 22:20.680
is enough to make His Grace so silent.

22:21.280 --> 22:23.160
This whole "hero brought low" act

22:23.760 --> 22:25.120
just makes me furious to watch!

22:27.360 --> 22:28.760
He's dying,

22:29.560 --> 22:31.400
barely holding on,

22:32.240 --> 22:34.640
just to catch a few more glimpses
of that Su Ningxi.

22:36.040 --> 22:37.240
Ignorance Demon,

22:37.320 --> 22:38.920
what are you getting at?

22:39.000 --> 22:40.040
Nothing much.

22:40.840 --> 22:44.240
It's just that power struggles
in the Dark Abyss are nothing new.

22:45.000 --> 22:47.400
The former Lord wasn't Sang Qi, was it?

23:11.240 --> 23:12.080
Sir.

23:14.200 --> 23:15.200
What's the situation?

23:16.440 --> 23:17.920
Sang Qi still refuses to see me.

23:18.640 --> 23:19.960
To be precise,

23:20.040 --> 23:22.920
since he took Su Ningxi's body
from the Mirage Palace,

23:23.000 --> 23:24.200
he hasn't seen anyone else.

23:27.720 --> 23:29.280
Sang Qi can't be relied upon anymore.

23:30.640 --> 23:33.920
That day, Su Ningzhen set up
a barrier in the Starfall Valley.

23:34.000 --> 23:35.440
I couldn't sneak it.

23:36.080 --> 23:38.240
So, I don't know what happened inside.

23:38.840 --> 23:41.040
Judging by Sang Qi's current state,

23:42.960 --> 23:44.280
that day…

23:44.360 --> 23:46.760
they must have discussed
something important.

23:47.360 --> 23:48.240
Most likely,

23:49.280 --> 23:50.520
it was a clue about the Chaos Pearl.

23:51.280 --> 23:52.360
Sir, it seems

23:52.440 --> 23:54.560
you'll need to personally
visit the Dark Abyss.

23:57.360 --> 23:58.480
One more thing.

23:58.560 --> 24:00.320
Xie Xuechen and Mu Xuanling have reached

24:00.400 --> 24:02.520
the Ethereal Jade Island
and entered the Phoenix Perch Forest.

24:03.200 --> 24:04.840
Shall we proceed to ambush them?

24:04.920 --> 24:06.120
The Phoenix Perch Forest?

24:10.200 --> 24:11.960
That place is overrun
with spirits and beasts.

24:12.920 --> 24:14.160
Few who enter ever leave.

24:14.800 --> 24:16.160
It's a one-way trip.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.400
Station men outside
the Phoenix Perch Forest.

24:23.640 --> 24:24.960
If they somehow make it out,

24:25.920 --> 24:27.160
strike while they're weak

24:28.560 --> 24:29.920
and finish them off immediately.

25:06.600 --> 25:08.040
Your heart is hard,

25:08.640 --> 25:10.000
but your lips are soft.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.360
There are so many petals here.

25:15.120 --> 25:15.960
Two of them

25:17.120 --> 25:18.440
were planted by me.

25:35.680 --> 25:36.520
Why didn't you speak when you woke up?

25:39.640 --> 25:40.760
Too weak to get up?

25:50.080 --> 25:51.040
I can manage on my own!

25:56.880 --> 25:57.720
You can see me again?

25:59.400 --> 26:00.360
What are you doing?

26:02.520 --> 26:03.760
If you are still blind,

26:04.760 --> 26:05.640
I could carry you on my back.

26:09.840 --> 26:11.000
If you can see…

26:14.120 --> 26:16.440
Then… Then what?

26:17.800 --> 26:18.680
Then we shall move on, of course.

26:19.840 --> 26:21.160
What did you think?

26:22.800 --> 26:24.200
I'll walk on my own.

26:25.640 --> 26:27.120
A disgrace to immortals,

26:27.200 --> 26:28.480
a beast in human clothing,

26:28.560 --> 26:29.920
and a shame to humanity.

26:30.000 --> 26:31.440
We're still within three zhang.

26:32.240 --> 26:34.080
I can hear everything you're saying.

26:48.680 --> 26:50.120
It seems like all the aura

26:50.920 --> 26:52.040
is flowing in one direction.

26:52.640 --> 26:54.640
I've heard that the Lotus of Life

26:54.720 --> 26:56.280
needs to absorb the world's aura to grow.

26:57.040 --> 26:58.160
There's another possibility.

26:59.480 --> 27:01.640
Someone with immense cultivation
is training there,

27:01.720 --> 27:02.800
absorbing spiritual power

27:02.880 --> 27:04.600
and causing these flows.

27:08.040 --> 27:09.600
There are enough artifacts
and spirit medicines here

27:10.200 --> 27:11.560
to get you out of the forest.

27:11.640 --> 27:12.800
Wait!

27:15.120 --> 27:17.880
Are you seriously after the Lotus of Life
or some medicine for eternal life?

27:18.480 --> 27:19.840
It's something more important

27:20.520 --> 27:21.480
than everlasting life.

27:21.560 --> 27:23.440
I've extended the range of String Bonding.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.040
If danger arises,

27:25.120 --> 27:26.680
you can leave immediately.
Don't worry about me.

27:30.920 --> 27:33.160
I've heard the Snow City is poor.

27:36.080 --> 27:37.520
What nonsense!

27:38.040 --> 27:40.040
You're clearly wealthy.

27:40.800 --> 27:41.920
Maybe

27:42.000 --> 27:45.520
I should take this chance
and run off with his shrinking pocket.

28:24.200 --> 28:26.240
So, this is the Waterless Land.

28:29.080 --> 28:30.640
The pool's liquid

28:30.720 --> 28:32.080
isn't actually water.

28:32.800 --> 28:34.200
It's condensed aura.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.440
No wonder they call it waterless.

29:12.040 --> 29:15.200
SAINT FENG XIANG

29:21.560 --> 29:22.840
So, this is the Lotus of Life.

29:23.520 --> 29:25.120
Such a thing really exists in this world.

29:32.040 --> 29:33.200
Who are you

29:33.800 --> 29:35.800
to dare desire the Lotus of Life?

29:38.720 --> 29:39.600
I am Xie Xuechen.

29:40.200 --> 29:42.160
I came here not for the Lotus of Life,

29:42.240 --> 29:43.640
but to request its seed.

29:45.240 --> 29:47.080
Xie Xuechen?

29:47.160 --> 29:48.680
I've never heard of you.

29:48.760 --> 29:50.400
A nobody

29:50.480 --> 29:52.320
dares to seek death here
at the Dark Cloud Mountain?

29:52.400 --> 29:54.160
Have you been waiting here all this time
for the lotus to bloom?

29:54.920 --> 29:56.440
The true value of the Lotus of Life

29:56.520 --> 29:57.720
lies in its petals and roots.

29:57.800 --> 29:59.280
I have no intention of competing for them.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.360
I only ask for one seed.

30:01.440 --> 30:03.200
Everyone knows

30:03.280 --> 30:05.320
the Lotus of Life
is the ultimate treasure.

30:06.040 --> 30:08.240
Its seeds, however,
are the most bitter thing in existence.

30:08.320 --> 30:09.200
What do you need it for?

30:09.800 --> 30:11.160
A friend of mine

30:11.240 --> 30:12.560
was poisoned by Disillusion Water.

30:12.640 --> 30:14.120
Her life is in danger.

30:14.200 --> 30:15.040
I urgently need the seed to save her.

30:16.240 --> 30:17.280
Lies.

30:18.360 --> 30:19.520
I don't believe anyone would go through

30:19.600 --> 30:20.880
all this trouble to find this place

30:21.560 --> 30:23.480
without seeking immortality!

30:31.960 --> 30:32.800
The Fire Phoenix Form…

30:34.360 --> 30:35.640
Your cultivation is quite impressive.

30:36.640 --> 30:38.840
You might handle a few more moves.

30:51.320 --> 30:52.160
This aura…

31:06.680 --> 31:08.000
Why are you here?

31:19.440 --> 31:20.640
To return your things.

31:20.720 --> 31:21.880
If you died,

31:21.960 --> 31:23.560
keeping your belongings

31:23.640 --> 31:24.520
would just bring bad luck.

31:26.240 --> 31:27.600
If I'd known she was this strong,

31:27.680 --> 31:28.680
I wouldn't have come.

31:34.440 --> 31:36.440
Your Grace, we mean no offense.

31:36.520 --> 31:38.080
Why press us so hard?

31:43.240 --> 31:44.680
The Jun Tian Sword…

31:45.360 --> 31:47.720
It was forged from the ancient
killing energy of chaos.

31:47.800 --> 31:48.960
It possesses a mind of its own.

31:49.600 --> 31:50.880
Who are you

31:50.960 --> 31:52.240
to have gained
Jun Tian's recognition as its master?

31:54.560 --> 31:56.000
He's the leader of the Immortal Alliance,

31:56.080 --> 31:57.600
born with ten spiritual channels,

31:57.680 --> 31:59.280
at the peak of cultivation.

31:59.360 --> 32:00.960
Why is it strange
that Jun Tian recognizes him?

32:01.040 --> 32:03.680
If you're scared, just back off.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.400
Nonsense.

32:06.960 --> 32:08.880
Lord Qian Guang is the true leader
of the Immortal Alliance.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.720
Lord Qian Guang?

32:11.680 --> 32:13.160
Isn't he
your first-generation Alliance leader?

32:13.880 --> 32:15.240
First generation?

32:16.280 --> 32:17.880
I've only been gone for a year.

32:17.960 --> 32:19.200
Did the Immortal Alliance
change leaders already?

32:19.800 --> 32:20.720
Your Grace,

32:21.240 --> 32:23.080
Lord Qian Guang
was the Alliance leader 6,000 years ago.

32:24.560 --> 32:25.720
Six thousand years?

32:29.120 --> 32:30.880
I've been in this Dark Cloud Mountain
for less than three days.

32:31.480 --> 32:32.600
How could it have been 6,000 years?

32:32.680 --> 32:34.000
What does she mean by this?

32:34.600 --> 32:36.080
Could she be from 6,000 years ago?

32:36.880 --> 32:39.040
But humans can't live that long.

32:39.120 --> 32:40.720
Who sent you two?

32:41.320 --> 32:42.960
What's your purpose in deceiving me
with these words?

32:44.000 --> 32:46.520
Six thousand years ago…
The Fire Phoenix Form…

32:47.520 --> 32:49.080
I think I know who she is now.

32:51.880 --> 32:52.760
You must

32:52.840 --> 32:56.160
be the founder of the Osprey Island,
Saint Feng Xiang.

32:56.240 --> 32:57.920
The Osprey Island's founder?

32:59.360 --> 33:00.720
That was 6,000 years ago too.

33:02.080 --> 33:04.360
Could it be there's something
unusual about this place?

33:05.280 --> 33:07.240
Have we traveled back 6,000 years,

33:07.960 --> 33:09.360
or has she come to our time?

33:11.160 --> 33:12.200
Six thousand years…

33:14.080 --> 33:15.400
Six thousand years…

33:16.280 --> 33:17.200
Six thousand years…

33:21.320 --> 33:23.800
Then, where is Lord Qian Guang now?

33:24.400 --> 33:25.760
It is said

33:25.840 --> 33:26.960
that after you retreated to the mountains,

33:27.560 --> 33:29.440
Lord Qian Guang resigned
as Alliance leader and followed you.

33:29.520 --> 33:31.000
No one knows his whereabouts now.

33:35.160 --> 33:36.240
Impossible…

33:37.320 --> 33:38.160
Impossible…

33:40.040 --> 33:40.880
Impossible…

33:41.520 --> 33:42.800
This can't be!

33:43.440 --> 33:44.400
No…

33:45.000 --> 33:46.160
This can't be…

33:46.760 --> 33:47.640
Lies…

33:48.320 --> 33:49.240
Lies…

33:50.200 --> 33:51.600
You're lying!

33:53.920 --> 33:55.040
How could this be?

33:59.600 --> 34:00.760
She seems to be losing control.

34:00.840 --> 34:02.120
It's the sign
of a spiritual form collapse. Run!

34:35.239 --> 34:36.159
Xuanling,

34:36.239 --> 34:37.360
are you okay?

34:38.760 --> 34:39.800
Get up.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.639
That was an explosion
caused by the spiritual form collapse.

34:44.719 --> 34:46.520
Feng Xiang might already

34:46.600 --> 34:47.760
be gone.

34:47.840 --> 34:49.320
Her spiritual form

34:49.400 --> 34:50.400
was a Fire Phoenix…

34:50.920 --> 34:52.600
No wonder this place
is called Phoenix Perch Forest.

34:54.080 --> 34:55.120
But humans don't live long lives,

34:55.880 --> 34:57.160
and she's from 6,000 years ago.

34:57.760 --> 34:59.120
How could she still be alive?

35:01.280 --> 35:03.920
Could it be that time
flows differently here,

35:04.000 --> 35:06.200
and a few days here
equate to 6,000 years outside?

35:06.880 --> 35:08.040
-Then we…
-It may not be as you think.

35:10.200 --> 35:11.640
The Dark Cloud Mountain is strange,

35:12.440 --> 35:13.880
but just based on Feng Xiang's words,

35:13.960 --> 35:15.720
it's not enough to draw such conclusions.

35:16.960 --> 35:18.000
However,

35:18.680 --> 35:20.480
the Lotus of Life only blooms
once every 100 years

35:20.560 --> 35:21.880
and produces its seeds.

35:23.120 --> 35:24.680
When I checked earlier,

35:24.760 --> 35:26.160
the Lotus of Life hadn't matured yet.

35:26.240 --> 35:27.440
If we want to obtain the seed,

35:28.000 --> 35:29.800
we may have to wait a while longer.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.160
I hope that explosion earlier

35:32.880 --> 35:34.440
didn't damage the Lotus of Life.

35:36.000 --> 35:37.160
So, what you're after

35:37.760 --> 35:38.600
is the lotus seed?

35:40.040 --> 35:41.440
Why do you need it so badly?

35:41.520 --> 35:43.360
Don't you know we almost died back there?

35:43.440 --> 35:44.840
I must get the seed.

35:45.800 --> 35:47.360
This is a matter of life and death for me.

35:48.360 --> 35:49.720
Look at how tense you are.

35:51.200 --> 35:53.600
If you're planning to wait here for years,

35:53.680 --> 35:54.880
count me out.

35:57.600 --> 35:58.960
I'm afraid I can't afford
to wait that long.

36:10.720 --> 36:11.760
This seed…

36:12.640 --> 36:13.840
Is it for yourself

36:15.560 --> 36:16.400
or for someone else?

36:25.680 --> 36:26.520
For someone else.

36:29.160 --> 36:30.400
They must be really important.

36:31.160 --> 36:32.560
Important enough for you to risk your life

36:33.160 --> 36:34.160
and be in such a hurry.

36:34.840 --> 36:36.160
Are they dying or something?

36:41.160 --> 36:43.200
What good is extending
the distance between us?

36:43.280 --> 36:44.720
Just undo it already.

36:44.800 --> 36:46.760
Don't drag me to your death!

36:49.720 --> 36:51.920
Then why did you come
looking for me earlier?

36:52.000 --> 36:53.840
Don't tell me
it was just to return my things.

36:54.600 --> 36:55.520
I…

36:55.600 --> 36:57.800
-I was just…
-You can stay here.

36:59.720 --> 37:01.040
Once the black mist clears,

37:01.760 --> 37:03.040
I'll go in and check again.

37:10.600 --> 37:12.800
By the time the mist clears,
it'll already be dark.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.480
Besides, you just said

37:14.560 --> 37:16.040
the Lotus of Life hasn't matured yet.

37:16.120 --> 37:17.320
You won't get the seed if you go now.

37:17.920 --> 37:19.160
Why are you in such a rush?

37:20.640 --> 37:21.680
Fine.

37:22.280 --> 37:23.720
I'll go check again tomorrow morning.

37:35.880 --> 37:37.400
ETHEREAL JADE ISLAND

37:40.400 --> 37:44.880
ETHEREAL JADE ISLAND PHARMACY

37:48.200 --> 37:49.240
Wait!

37:52.000 --> 37:53.360
We've stepped into an array.

37:55.320 --> 37:56.960
Are you heading
to the Phoenix Perch Forest?

37:58.160 --> 38:00.040
I always like to plan thoroughly.

38:00.560 --> 38:01.600
Unfortunately for you,

38:02.360 --> 38:05.200
you've stepped into the array
I set here on the Ethereal Jade Island.

38:06.000 --> 38:07.200
Even more unfortunate,

38:07.960 --> 38:09.000
arrays come in four types.

38:09.080 --> 38:12.280
Trapping array, defensive array,
killing array, and confusing array.

38:13.240 --> 38:15.120
And today, on a whim,

38:15.640 --> 38:16.720
I set up a killing array.

38:21.240 --> 38:21.920
Form the array!

38:28.000 --> 38:29.160
Run!

38:33.040 --> 38:33.880
Don't rush.

38:34.840 --> 38:37.360
I still have something
needing you two to take back.

38:38.080 --> 38:39.480
Tell your master this.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.960
Mu Xuanling is under my protection.

38:42.840 --> 38:43.920
If he dares make a move,

38:44.880 --> 38:46.960
I won't hesitate to destroy
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion first.

38:55.320 --> 38:59.200
The forest is filled with illusions.
Finding them won't be easy.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.280
No matter.

39:00.800 --> 39:02.520
Clear this area first.

39:03.520 --> 39:04.560
Understood.

39:09.400 --> 39:11.200
This forest is indeed strange.

39:13.040 --> 39:13.960
The dense forest

39:14.680 --> 39:15.800
blocks the stars and moon.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.880
It's hard to tell directions.

39:19.000 --> 39:20.600
Let's find a place to rest first.

39:21.800 --> 39:22.760
All right.

39:24.720 --> 39:25.960
Sir,

39:26.040 --> 39:27.360
the fog is too thick.

39:28.960 --> 39:29.840
It's easy to get separated.

39:30.360 --> 39:31.360
Why don't we…

39:33.240 --> 39:34.080
Sir?

39:45.560 --> 39:46.720
Mr. Nan.

39:53.160 --> 39:55.040
I got separated from Xie Xuechen.

39:55.120 --> 39:56.560
I've been wandering
in the fog for so long.

39:57.400 --> 39:58.320
Luckily, I ran into you.

40:03.320 --> 40:04.680
Why are you here?

40:05.960 --> 40:07.120
This place is so dangerous.

40:12.000 --> 40:12.920
Did you come for me?

40:18.080 --> 40:19.600
It's dark, and the path is tough.

40:20.200 --> 40:21.840
Let me take you somewhere to rest.

40:21.920 --> 40:23.080
Is that all right?

40:35.080 --> 40:37.000
No one can ever replace her,

40:38.960 --> 40:40.560
nor can anything

40:41.400 --> 40:43.240
hope to fake her.

40:58.560 --> 40:59.440
Feng Yao…

41:03.440 --> 41:04.520
Yuan!

41:06.600 --> 41:07.720
Feng Yao!

41:07.800 --> 41:09.440
This place is so scary.

41:09.520 --> 41:11.680
I've been trying to find a way out,

41:12.440 --> 41:14.680
but I just can't.

41:16.360 --> 41:18.080
Why aren't you saying anything?

41:18.880 --> 41:20.480
Don't you want me anymore?

41:21.080 --> 41:22.720
Just like back then?

41:22.800 --> 41:23.640
No!

41:24.160 --> 41:25.760
I never wanted to leave you,

41:25.840 --> 41:27.160
not once.

41:27.240 --> 41:29.760
But when the evil cultivators came,

41:29.840 --> 41:31.160
why weren't you there?

41:32.400 --> 41:33.440
I'm sorry.

41:34.200 --> 41:36.000
I failed to protect you.

41:36.080 --> 41:37.040
I don't blame you,

41:38.400 --> 41:40.480
but I'm so scared.

41:40.560 --> 41:41.920
It's so cold here.

41:42.000 --> 41:44.400
Stay with me, please?

41:46.240 --> 41:47.680
You promised

41:47.760 --> 41:49.600
you'd always be with me,

41:49.680 --> 41:50.720
remember?

41:51.440 --> 41:53.120
Stay with me, please?

41:53.960 --> 41:55.040
No.

41:55.120 --> 41:56.360
You can't stay here.

41:56.440 --> 41:57.320
Let me take you away.

41:58.120 --> 41:59.720
You just want to leave me behind!

42:00.360 --> 42:02.720
You don't want me anymore.
Then I don't want you either!

42:02.800 --> 42:04.600
Yuan! Yuan!

42:05.200 --> 42:06.280
Yuan…

42:16.080 --> 42:17.360
He's not your brother.

42:20.520 --> 42:22.200
Deep down, you know that too.

42:22.920 --> 42:24.960
He's been dead for 11 years.

42:27.840 --> 42:29.240
I failed to protect him.

42:30.880 --> 42:33.640
He was killed by evil cultivators,
not you.

42:35.120 --> 42:36.200
Get up.

42:38.120 --> 42:39.560
Stand on your own.

42:50.480 --> 42:51.480
I thought

42:52.680 --> 42:53.760
it was supposed to be me protecting you.

42:57.920 --> 43:00.240
They say this Phoenix Perch Forest
is dangerous beyond measure.

43:01.400 --> 43:04.520
Its dangers aren't about strength,

43:05.440 --> 43:06.280
but resolve.

43:11.120 --> 43:12.960
Did you encounter
someone you wanted to see?

43:15.920 --> 43:16.840
I did.

43:17.600 --> 43:18.840
-And then?
-I killed it.

43:24.360 --> 43:26.000
It seems your mind is clear.

43:26.800 --> 43:27.800
You'd rather destroy something

43:28.520 --> 43:29.480
than accept a fake.

43:31.520 --> 43:32.960
Let's rest for the night.

43:34.160 --> 43:35.920
Once the fog clears, we'll move on.
